00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:27.160
<i>The burrow is cold...</i>

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:27.160
<i>The burrow is cold...</i>

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:40.030
That night, Ronja dreamt.

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:56.980
Yes, I'm coming...

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:00.320
Ronja!

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:02.970
Don't go!

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:10.660
But she had forgotten all about the dream

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.980
